COPY public.privacy_policy (id, content, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
1	<p></p><h3><strong>1. Introduction</strong></h3><p>Welcome to <strong>WotchaGotcha</strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal data you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website, utilize our mobile applications, or participate in our multi-media social platform across all 13 interactive modules (including Video Mania, On-News, Sport &amp; Sport, Pic Tours, Mondo Market, Open Letters, tvProgMax, Cinematic, and more).</p><h3><strong>2. Information We Collect</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Account &amp; Profile Information:</strong> When you register for an account, we collect your username, email address, country, profile avatar, creator badge tier, and encrypted credentials.</p></li><li><p><strong>User Generated Content:</strong> Photos, videos, letters, audio clips, marketplace listings, comments, replies, and community interactions you publish on the platform.</p></li><li><p><strong>Usage &amp; Device Analytics:</strong> Technical identifiers, IP address, device model, operating system, browser type, interaction timestamps, and FCM push notification tokens for live updates.</p></li><li><p><strong>Financial &amp; Payment Data:</strong> For marketplace transactions, paid promotions, and creator badges, payment processing is handled through secure third-party payment gateways with industry-standard encryption.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>3. How We Use Your Information</strong></h3><ul><li><p>To provide, personalize, and maintain all multimedia features across our 13 interactive modules.</p></li><li><p>To deliver real-time notifications for likes, comments, replies, mentions, and creator engagements.</p></li><li><p>To protect user safety, prevent spam, enforce platform community guidelines, and investigate malicious conduct.</p></li><li><p>To process transactions, creator verification, and premium subscription features.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>4. Data Security &amp; Retention</strong></h3><p>We implement rigorous technical and organizational measures, including end-to-end transport layer security (TLS/HTTPS), secure PostgreSQL role policies, and password hashing (bcrypt) to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction of your personal information.</p><h3><strong>5. Your Privacy Rights &amp; Controls</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Access &amp; Correction:</strong> You can review and update your profile details directly from Account Settings.</p></li><li><p><strong>Privacy Visibility:</strong> You can toggle profile discovery, activity status, and direct message permissions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Deletion:</strong> You have the right to permanently request the deletion of your account and associated media data at any time.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>6. Contact Us</strong></h3><p>If you have any questions, inquiries, or privacy requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our Data Protection Team at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="mailto:privacy@wotcha-gotcha.com">privacy@wotcha-gotcha.com</a> or reach out through our official support center.</p>	2026-08-25 14:32:24.647527+05	2026-08-25 14:36:09.711679+05
\.
